{
  "source": "Prompts/how-ai-learns-v11.mp4",
  "duration": 203.8186875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.98,
      "text": "Modern AI can explain complex chemistry, write functional code, and help you improve an essay."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.7,
      "end": 8.14,
      "text": "How did it learn to do those things?"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.12,
      "end": 10.58,
      "text": "Think about learning to shoot a basketball."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.24,
      "end": 14.86,
      "text": "You try a shot, see how you did, and make an adjustment to your mechanics."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.78,
      "end": 18.18,
      "text": "AI also learns through repeated attempts."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.88,
      "end": 22.88,
      "text": "Let's follow the process from preparation to a model that is ready to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.68,
      "end": 25.4,
      "text": "Two things happen before training starts."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.94,
      "end": 27.22,
      "text": "First, set up the system."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.22,
      "end": 31.36,
      "text": "Engineers design the model and give its internal numbers starting values."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.18,
      "end": 34.22,
      "text": "Training will adjust those numbers as the model learns."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.1,
      "end": 36.42,
      "text": "Second, gather the data."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.3,
      "end": 42.42,
      "text": "Teams collect books, websites, conversations, code, images, audio, and video."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.12,
      "end": 44.24,
      "text": "This becomes the curriculum."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.76,
      "end": 48.16,
      "text": "Training builds different abilities in three main phases."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.02,
      "end": 51.08,
      "text": "Phase one is pre-training, learn patterns."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.82,
      "end": 54.62,
      "text": "Phase two is instruction tuning, learn to follow instructions."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.12,
      "end": 58.66,
      "text": "Phase three is preference tuning, improve responses through feedback."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.86,
      "end": 62.74,
      "text": "Across all three phases, training follows a basic loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.56,
      "end": 65.02,
      "text": "Guess, check, and adjust."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.82,
      "end": 69.4,
      "text": "What changes is the examples and feedback used to guide those adjustments."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.16,
      "end": 71.18,
      "text": "Here is a simple example."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.16,
      "end": 75.9,
      "text": "Given the phrase peanut butter and blank, the model makes a guess."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.4,
      "end": 78.24,
      "text": "In this instance, it guesses cloud."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.12,
      "end": 80.0,
      "text": "Next is the check."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 85.42,
      "text": "The actual training example says jelly, so the system compares its guess with that correct word."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.32,
      "end": 87.52,
      "text": "Finally, the adjust phase."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.1,
      "end": 92.86,
      "text": "The system tweaks its internal numbers to make jelly more likely in this specific situation."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.54,
      "end": 95.64,
      "text": "Then, the loop runs again on the next example."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.36,
      "end": 99.88,
      "text": "Those adjustments change the model's internal numbers, called weights."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.9,
      "end": 103.72,
      "text": "Now, let's look at the first phase of training called pre-training."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.44,
      "end": 109.06,
      "text": "In pre-training, the model learns from more text than you could read in 1000 lifetimes."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.06,
      "end": 114.88,
      "text": "Across vast amounts of text and code, it learns broad patterns in language and information."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.7,
      "end": 119.94,
      "text": "The model can produce fluent text, but it doesn't reliably follow your instructions yet."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.96,
      "end": 122.8,
      "text": "Training keeps adjusting the model's weights."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.62,
      "end": 128.56,
      "text": "What changes in the next phases is the kind of examples and feedback used to guide those adjustments."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.32,
      "end": 131.6,
      "text": "This brings us to phase two, instruction tuning."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.34,
      "end": 135.74,
      "text": "Now, people provide questions paired with helpful example answers."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.74,
      "end": 142.3,
      "text": "The model practices answering those questions, adjusting its weights, so its answers become more like those human examples."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.22,
      "end": 148.6,
      "text": "The model can follow a request, but its answer may still be unclear, incomplete, or unhelpful."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.64,
      "end": 150.72,
      "text": "Following instructions is a start."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.52,
      "end": 155.54,
      "text": "Next, the model learns from feedback about which answers people find more helpful."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.1,
      "end": 157.06,
      "text": "That's preference tuning."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.8,
      "end": 161.04,
      "text": "In phase three, the model produces several answers to a question."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.04,
      "end": 166.68,
      "text": "People compare those answers and select the best one, based on clear, useful, and accurate information."
    },
    {
      "start": 167.68,
      "end": 171.48,
      "text": "Training adjusts the model's weights to make answers like the selected one more likely."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.34,
      "end": 173.9,
      "text": "However, there is still work to do."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.28,
      "end": 178.54,
      "text": "Feedback helps improve the answers, but AI can still give a wrong answer that sounds right."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.44,
      "end": 181.72,
      "text": "When training ends, the model is ready to use."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.24,
      "end": 186.88,
      "text": "It relies entirely on the final internal weights produced by that long three-phase process."
    },
    {
      "start": 186.88,
      "end": 193.06,
      "text": "During a normal chat, it can work with new information you give it, but your conversation does not change those weights."
    },
    {
      "start": 194.02,
      "end": 195.76,
      "text": "AI learns from examples and feedback."
    },
    {
      "start": 196.52,
      "end": 197.98,
      "text": "Guess, check, adjust."
    },
    {
      "start": 198.98,
      "end": 199.04,
      "text": "Repeat."
    }
  ],
